      "t": "h3",
      "text": "What happened"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The Fall 2026 drop is live and the product pages read beautifully. Underneath, the storefront has drifted: a sold-out belt in a top slot, a “Pre-Order” page selling sale stock, three copies of All Belts, and tags that contradict the…"
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Stock health"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "516 of 631 size variants are in stock and only 4 of 164 products are fully sold out. There's plenty of product to merchandise."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Size-level states"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The theme already knows “Available”, “Low Availability” and “Pre-Order” per size, and has Klaviyo waitlist hooks wired in."
    },
